<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Mexico Autlan raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Mexico Autlan raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finamex brokerage said on Thursday it raised its rating on Mexican manganese firm Compania Minera Autlan to buy from hold.</p>
<p>&quot;Prices for its manganese alloys have bottomed out, with a solid recovery expected in the second half of 1997. This alone would justify a buy recommendation,&quot; mining and steel analyst Christopher Albi said in a report.</p>
</text>
